  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "This is something I've noticed while making worlds and it's most noticeable when the trigger activates a sound and you hear it playing twice. I think in one world I've heard it activate 3+ times. It's a small bug, but worth mentioning.\nEdit: As requested, the version number. Currently it occurs on the client version 2019.2.1p5 (build 751) and SDK 2019.04.14.12.31 and has been happening for many versions before this, how far back I'm not entirely sure though. ",
